>Sally</span>: Are you serious? Is that a viable option?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I think so. I'm going to have to try it out. I'm running out of options. I'm waking up tired every morning. It's like I never went to sleep. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh boy!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I have got to get rid of this insomnia. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Shouldn't you talk to your doctor first? </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Of course. I'm going to see him this afternoon."}, {"time": "47400", "image": "engenn6le08ob05re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Good. You should always consult your doctor before you make any kind of decisions about your health.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Definitely. I hope he'll refer me to someone. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Isn't there a more natural approach? There ought to be. This doesn't sound safe."}, {"time": "64000", "image": "engenn6le08ob05re2img05.jpg", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: My doctor advised meditation, guided imagery and aromatherapy.  I've tried them all, nothing seems to do the trick.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You should try a natural remedy. You need to try acupuncture. Didn't Aunt Nelly try that out for her arthritis? </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Mhm. I'll talk to my doctor."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le08ob05re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le08ob05re2aud01", "images": []}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 3, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa Has a Nightmare"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Hypnosis"}, {"type": "position", "content": 5}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > The Inner Mind > Hypnosis is Still a Mystery"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 8}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify and provide solutions to problems in a range of social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le08ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to sync"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to happen at the same time as something else"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My sleep-wake cycle isn't syncing up with my day."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob05aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hypnosis"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a state similar to sleep, in which someone's thoughts can be influenced by someone else"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm going to try hypnosis."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob05aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "viable"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "having the ability to work successfully"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Is that a viable option?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob05aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "insomnia"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not able to sleep"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have to get rid of this insomnia. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob05aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to consult"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to ask for information or advice from someone "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You should always consult your doctor."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob05aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "meditation"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the practice of emptying your mind of thoughts and feelings, in order to relax completely"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I've tried mediation. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob05aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "guided imagery "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the practice of using words and music to relax completely"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I don't think guided imagery works for me. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob05aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "aromatherapy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the practice  of using essential oils to relax completely "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I enjoy aromatherapy from time to time."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob05aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "remedy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a medicine to cure an illness or pain that is not very serious"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You should try a natural remedy. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob05aud09"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Simple Present vs. Present Continuous "}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": " There are verbs that hardly ever take the continuous. This is because they express states that are permanent and not subject to a frequent change. <br/>Among these verbs we find verbs of the mind: <span class=\"italic\">know</span>, <span class=\"italic\">understand</span>, <span class=\"italic\">hope</span>, <span class=\"italic\">mean</span>, <span class=\"italic\">think</span>.  "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Examples: <ul><li><span class=\"italic product-color-text\">What do you mean?</span></li> <li><span class=\"italic product-color-text\">I think I may have a solution to this problem.</span></li><li><span class=\"italic product-color-text\">I hope he'll refer me to someone.</span></li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Pesent continuous gives the actions limited duration and  makes them temporary."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example:<ul><li><span class=\"italic product-color-text\">I'm running out of options.</span></li></ul>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Expressing What is Necessary"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the modal <span class=\"italic\">must</span> or expressions like You <span class=\"italic\">have</span> got to ... or <span class=\"italic\">going to have to</span> to express what is necessary.</p>  You can also use a superlative adjective when expressing what is necessary. Remember you always use <span class=\"italic\">the</span> with the superlative."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm going to have to try meditation. It's the most recommended option."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You'd better try acupuncture. It's the best remedy."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the following to express what is necessary: <ul><li>You had better ...</li> <li>You have got to ...</li> <li>I'm going to have to ...</li> <li>You need to ...</li></ul>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go on the internet. Do some research about insomnia."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find different treatments for insomnia. Write them down."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a short report about the treatment you found."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Put them in order from the one you would recommend to the one you would not recommend."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use expressions to say which are necessary and provide a solution.  "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Proofread your report. Give it to a friend to read."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I offer advice and solutions to a problem."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about what is necessary."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share my report with a friend."}]}]}